<title>Indonesia: London Sumatra 1996 net up to 80.62 bln rph.</title>
<headline>London Sumatra 1996 net up to 80.62 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			  80.62 vs  61.42</p>
<p>    Sales			    208.65 vs 188.64</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   115.25 vs 104.93</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     101.89 vs  94.58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 102.82 vs  85.14</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    102.60 vs  21.98</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT PP London Sumatra Indonesia is among the largest plantation firms in Indonesia.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
